        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "5848edf1-2023-3cf5-8d64-db468036caec",
                "word": "bemerking",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b5c015a5-f15b-410f-9721-01490288a42d",
                        "entry_id": "5848edf1-2023-3cf5-8d64-db468036caec",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "bemerkingen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4ed9624d-acbb-3843-89d6-c8804dfa1926",
                        "entry_id": "5848edf1-2023-3cf5-8d64-db468036caec",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een waarneming met een oordeel"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "63d0cb6b-50a4-4de6-b7cc-533e9066cfeb",
                                "sense_id": "4ed9624d-acbb-3843-89d6-c8804dfa1926",
                                "text": "Wat brengt 2016? Een paar bemerkingen. De autonome omzetontwikkeling van het concern (met name voeding) was in 2015 positief. In 2016, waarin de winstmarge bij veel cyclische bedrijven onder druk staat, ontpopt DSM zich mogelijk (met een verwachte winstmargeverbetering) tot dé positieve uitzondering. Door een eerder ingezette kostenreductieprogramma lijkt de brutowinst-marge, na twee teleurstellende jaren, de opgaande lijn op te pakken."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab91a14e-0c2b-4469-9b94-f89540bb8eb6",
                                "sense_id": "4ed9624d-acbb-3843-89d6-c8804dfa1926",
                                "text": "Het kabinet van Van Overtveldt geeft de bemerkingen toe. De komende dagen zal er overleg worden gepleegd met de Nationale Bank. Volgens de minister kan een en ander sneller verlopen. Woordvoerder Ferry Comhair laat ook verstaan dat de volledige studie niet in een keer moet worden opgeleverd. ‘Sommige stukken kunnen vroeger worden gelost.’"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "22002091-abd3-4b18-a780-0fcfa1a2f61a",
                        "source_entry_id": "5848edf1-2023-3cf5-8d64-db468036caec",
                        "source_sense_id": "4ed9624d-acbb-3843-89d6-c8804dfa1926",
                        "target_lang_word": "observation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "observation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3abf0ab0-1e3e-3c02-a162-2874166c18a0",
                                        "entry_id": "43e28c9b-4700-344b-b0cb-3a5098c3fa31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of observing, and the fact of being observed (see observance)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f52adee-6dda-4a94-909c-82f610ccd29c",
                                                "sense_id": "3abf0ab0-1e3e-3c02-a162-2874166c18a0",
                                                "text": "But Miss Thorn relieved the situation by laughing aloud,[…]. We began to tell her about Mohair and the cotillon, and of our point of observation from the Florentine galleried porch, and she insisted she would join us there."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b080237a-67f1-4b93-a1b4-1122d7d838e1",
                                                "sense_id": "3abf0ab0-1e3e-3c02-a162-2874166c18a0",
                                                "text": "The physics of elementary particles in the 20th century was distinguished by the observation of particles whose existence had been predicted by theorists sometimes decades earlier."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50015863-b5ef-3d72-8870-fc2ecc2933ca",
                                        "entry_id": "43e28c9b-4700-344b-b0cb-3a5098c3fa31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of noting and recording some event; or the record of such noting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50c2fcca-12f9-38ad-90f5-2acf1ae9361e",
                                        "entry_id": "43e28c9b-4700-344b-b0cb-3a5098c3fa31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A remark or comment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b35c001d-8c63-47dc-9a39-2b5be4419f02",
                                                "sense_id": "50c2fcca-12f9-38ad-90f5-2acf1ae9361e",
                                                "text": "That's a foolish observation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "060e5205-9e5c-4893-91ae-3fe211cda038",
                                                "sense_id": "50c2fcca-12f9-38ad-90f5-2acf1ae9361e",
                                                "text": "To observations which ourselves we make / We grow more partial for the observer's sake."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "14e7936c-204e-3177-ab50-6d5ab8134970",
                                        "entry_id": "43e28c9b-4700-344b-b0cb-3a5098c3fa31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A judgement based on observing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c6e659a-9023-4f4f-90f8-f751f1b3ad3f",
                                                "sense_id": "14e7936c-204e-3177-ab50-6d5ab8134970",
                                                "text": "This hypothesis goes by many names, including group resistence, the threshold effect, and the gender paradox. Because the hypothesis holds such wide appeal, it is worth revisiting the logic behind it. The hypothesis is built on the factual observation that fewer females than males act antisocially."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "80afc4dd-4ab2-3b83-952b-7c00b72f5b0c",
                                        "entry_id": "43e28c9b-4700-344b-b0cb-3a5098c3fa31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Performance of what is prescribed; adherence in practice; observance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e37062b1-09f8-4aa9-9016-57a70ec9c3ca",
                                                "sense_id": "80afc4dd-4ab2-3b83-952b-7c00b72f5b0c",
                                                "text": "We are to procure dispensation or leave to omit the observation of it in such circumstances."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9aae5d93-1ab9-3a7a-aba6-54c3006c6249",
                                        "entry_id": "43e28c9b-4700-344b-b0cb-3a5098c3fa31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A regime under which a subject is routinely observed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10f368cb-b54d-353b-9f1f-1dbab5e783f7",
                                        "entry_id": "43e28c9b-4700-344b-b0cb-3a5098c3fa31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A realization of a random variable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "27ed8244-1bbd-4e5d-b942-7747ccbc4d08",
                        "source_entry_id": "5848edf1-2023-3cf5-8d64-db468036caec",
                        "source_sense_id": "4ed9624d-acbb-3843-89d6-c8804dfa1926",
                        "target_lang_word": "remark",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "remark",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d6c63463-694b-3864-8b20-9d7b0ea9dd3d",
                                        "entry_id": "eda4c6f1-d5da-3143-a654-8af13bd09d1f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act of pointing out or noticing; notice or observation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f80c005e-2fb2-47c6-83bc-ac6a37c7a0a8",
                                                "sense_id": "d6c63463-694b-3864-8b20-9d7b0ea9dd3d",
                                                "text": "It is worth remark that the Japanese railways are among the busiest in the world; moreover, their traffic is growing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96c14c4d-a34e-3f71-a8b5-ca47b79524b3",
                                        "entry_id": "eda4c6f1-d5da-3143-a654-8af13bd09d1f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An expression, in speech or writing, of something remarked or noticed; a mention of something"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c93c836a-2a75-4b83-87e3-a0af82da47b0",
                                                "sense_id": "96c14c4d-a34e-3f71-a8b5-ca47b79524b3",
                                                "text": "make a remark"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1311fa5a-1bd3-4664-9718-c3f17ff8feb4",
                                                "sense_id": "96c14c4d-a34e-3f71-a8b5-ca47b79524b3",
                                                "text": "pass a remark"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05d84137-85b9-465c-a581-b826cd8c1629",
                                                "sense_id": "96c14c4d-a34e-3f71-a8b5-ca47b79524b3",
                                                "text": "a biting remark"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bad57bb8-d956-4fa6-9158-3cab8f6234c5",
                                                "sense_id": "96c14c4d-a34e-3f71-a8b5-ca47b79524b3",
                                                "text": "a funny remark"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a29aeb1-9605-455d-8381-7ad6afbae326",
                                                "sense_id": "96c14c4d-a34e-3f71-a8b5-ca47b79524b3",
                                                "text": "a spoken remark"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51b4ae71-f679-41f2-b16c-cbd03bb8c209",
                                                "sense_id": "96c14c4d-a34e-3f71-a8b5-ca47b79524b3",
                                                "text": "One saint's day in mid-term a certain newly appointed suffragan-bishop came to the school chapel, and there preached on “The Inner Life.” He at once secured attention by his informal method, and when presently the coughing of Jarvis […] interrupted the sermon, he altogether captivated his audience with a remark about cough lozenges being cheap and easily procurable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "104ea315-21ab-4bbb-8af5-093eb37cacfc",
                                                "sense_id": "96c14c4d-a34e-3f71-a8b5-ca47b79524b3",
                                                "text": "But the journey might have been one of several hours’ duration, without provoking a remark from either; for it was clear that Jonas did not mean to break the silence which prevailed between them, and that it was not, as yet, his dear friend’s cue to tempt them into conversation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2d574fa1-e846-3443-8c95-92a5a6b7bd37",
                                        "entry_id": "eda4c6f1-d5da-3143-a654-8af13bd09d1f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A casual observation, comment, or statement"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec0a74a4-bfe7-4d4a-a13e-38ea6cf6b122",
                                                "sense_id": "2d574fa1-e846-3443-8c95-92a5a6b7bd37",
                                                "text": "He remembers something Pete Huntley said at lunch, just a remark in passing, and the answer comes to him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "747fd488-f8c5-3334-ba06-4554f67ad23a",
                                        "entry_id": "eda4c6f1-d5da-3143-a654-8af13bd09d1f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of remarque."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "remark",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad0cee8a-9b22-3cf8-acb7-d56febeb4bb2",
                                        "entry_id": "b4cab1e4-d173-3654-8c8e-ed6137a72d66",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To pay heed to; notice; to take notice of, to perceive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cbff980-0df6-4005-b079-24c136b97653",
                                                "sense_id": "ad0cee8a-9b22-3cf8-acb7-d56febeb4bb2",
                                                "text": "I remarked a certain twang in his southern pronunciation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7232879a-f534-4944-8b0a-dfc508eb1d8d",
                                                "sense_id": "ad0cee8a-9b22-3cf8-acb7-d56febeb4bb2",
                                                "text": "\"Did you ever remark that door?\" he asked; and when his companion had replied in the affirmative, \"It is connected in my mind,\" added he, \"with a very odd story.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38fb6d9f-24a2-44c3-b93f-86a52b99a3f7",
                                                "sense_id": "ad0cee8a-9b22-3cf8-acb7-d56febeb4bb2",
                                                "text": "When travelling in Spain, Willkomm remarked qobar at a distance of 3 or 4 miles, yet, on reaching the actual spot, he saw nothing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6187a4b-3809-4424-81f8-d230b0dfdec8",
                                                "sense_id": "ad0cee8a-9b22-3cf8-acb7-d56febeb4bb2",
                                                "text": "“Let's just be grateful he's alive,” said Kate, and several heads turned sharply, remarking this unaccustomed display of feeling from a Fifth Floor lady."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54083719-f47a-3869-911f-866bddbf3b17",
                                        "entry_id": "b4cab1e4-d173-3654-8c8e-ed6137a72d66",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To pass comment on (something); to indicate, point out."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6cf703a-3d02-44bd-b2fc-e190cb954cd8",
                                                "sense_id": "54083719-f47a-3869-911f-866bddbf3b17",
                                                "text": "[S]he resolved to […] enter into conversation with her, by remarking the warmth of the room and the length of the dance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "137d30a8-fe86-3c72-8f1d-e832173821cb",
                                        "entry_id": "b4cab1e4-d173-3654-8c8e-ed6137a72d66",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To mark (someone or something) out; to distinguish, to make notable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afb81dc0-d46a-4ad1-96a5-42a716d72509",
                                                "sense_id": "137d30a8-fe86-3c72-8f1d-e832173821cb",
                                                "text": "His manacles remark him; there he sits."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f70acf29-5ed4-33c2-90ae-de63a9fc9d1b",
                                        "entry_id": "b4cab1e4-d173-3654-8c8e-ed6137a72d66",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To express in words or writing; to state, as an observation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3887bbda-662f-4b0b-aa96-f5945adf9e1f",
                                                "sense_id": "f70acf29-5ed4-33c2-90ae-de63a9fc9d1b",
                                                "text": "He remarked that it was getting late."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94dcb441-9df3-4a5a-8835-3d34a1c45ad2",
                                                "sense_id": "f70acf29-5ed4-33c2-90ae-de63a9fc9d1b",
                                                "text": "Thou art a man remark't to taſt a miſchiefe, / Looke for't; though it come late, it vvill come ſure."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f92a72f5-2982-43b8-9d11-3bf01a3c2b17",
                                                "sense_id": "f70acf29-5ed4-33c2-90ae-de63a9fc9d1b",
                                                "text": "He looked at me with pity, which caused me to smile, remarking that I had noticed that here and elsewhere in the east, the heroes had monuments or statues erected to their memory[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "778255a4-60ca-32fe-9d9a-55de87dc2ebf",
                                        "entry_id": "b4cab1e4-d173-3654-8c8e-ed6137a72d66",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a remark or remarks on, to comment on (something)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "remark",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
